All other npm packages in the lockfile are MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD, or
similarly permissive licensed packages.

Rust / Cargo dependencies
-------------------------

The direct crates in src-tauri/Cargo.toml use permissive licenses, primarily
MIT OR Apache-2.0. In particular, ring is ISC; rusqlite, reqwest, serde,
serde_json, regex, uuid, time, toml, thiserror, aes, base64, cbc, pbkdf2,
sha1, sha2, once_cell, dirs, libc, winreg, tauri, tauri-build,
tauri-plugin-autostart, and tauri-plugin-dialog are MIT, Apache-2.0, or
MIT OR Apache-2.0 licensed according to their upstream package metadata.

The complete resolved Rust dependency set and versions are recorded in
src-tauri/Cargo.lock. Cargo's bundled SQLite build is distributed under the
SQLite public domain dedication.

